1
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,000
Time's up.

2
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,239
Those cowards aren't coming to save you.

3
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:29,559
All units, ready!

4
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,079
Fire!

5
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,000
Run! Run!

6
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,119
This way!

7
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:10,920
Run! Hurry!

8
00:01:13,319 --> 00:01:13,719
Come on!

9
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:16,760
Run that way!

10
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:26,239
Spread out, quick!

11
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,280
Watch out!

12
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,400
Yu Mo

13
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,800
What do you want to be when you grow up?

14
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:22,680
I want to be a police officer.

15
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:25,280
Comrade Li Mingyuan is hereby appointed

16
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,919
as Deputy Chief of Rongcheng Police,

17
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,759
effective immediately.

18
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:31,439
I thought

19
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,759
a new deputy chief would change things,

20
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,360
but crows are black the world over.

21
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:39,159
My mom won't let me work at the station.

22
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,639
She says no one there is any good.

23
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,120
I'm no commander.

24
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,840
I'm just an ordinary police officer.

25
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,919
I'm the Deputy Chief of Rongcheng Police.

26
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,400
Protecting the people is my duty.

27
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,960
I can't leave.

28
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:59,319
Thanks to the timely intel you provided,

29
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,639
we wiped out the Japanese in one swoop

30
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,240
and spared Rongcheng from the war.

31
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,519
Word came from our informant.

32
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,319
The civilians were safely rescued.

33
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:53,360
The Rongcheng police force...

34
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,680
all gave their lives for our country.

35
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,560
Brothers!

36
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,879
Reinforcements will be here soon!

37
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:16,160
Our mission is to help our reinforcements

38
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,600
by pinning down the Japanese in the city

39
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,600
and opening Rongcheng's gates for them!

40
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,199
I ask you all

41
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,680
to cooperate with Captain Xu

42
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,680
and fight alongside the CPC Guerrillas!

43
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:34,759
Slay the invaders!

44
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:37,040
Defend our homeland!

45
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:38,720
Slay the invaders!

46
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,920
Defend our homeland!

47
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:41,279
Slay the invaders!

48
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,560
Defend our homeland!

49
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:44,920
Move out!

50
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,920
Let's move out too.

51
00:06:46,199 --> 00:06:46,920
Hurry, go find Lian Yu!

52
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,839
Lian Yu! Lian Yu!

53
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:15,600
Who are you?

54
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,480
Lian Yu, do you remember me?

55
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,959
Don't be afraid. Go ahead and eat.

56
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:38,800
Lian Yu.

57
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,560
I'm a friend of your brother, Lian Ye.

58
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,720
I'm here to save you.

59
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:42,920
Come over here, quick.

60
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:16,439
Yuna.

61
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,720
Pick up the knife.

62
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,959
Kill him.

63
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:30,839
What are you waiting for?

64
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:33,240
Kill him!

65
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,000
Lian Yu!

66
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,600
Kill him, Yuna!

67
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:52,519
Kill him!

68
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,320
Little Lian Yu...

69
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,120
"The sun illuminates the day,

70
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,440
the moon brightens the night."

71
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,600
Mother combed through the scriptures

72
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,080
to give you this name

73
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,600
so your heart would seek the light.

74
00:09:17,759 --> 00:09:18,919
Remember this:

75
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,440
You are Chinese,

76
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,399
not Japanese!

77
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,759
Yuna!

78
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,679
Kill him!

79
00:09:26,279 --> 00:09:26,840
Lian Yu!

80
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,559
I'm your brother, Lian Ye!

81
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:38,000
My name is Lian Yu!

82
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,240
Are you all right?

83
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,240
We're fine.

84
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:03,200
Let's go.

85
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:05,120
Rendezvous with Captain Xu at the tower.

86
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,759
Move, move!

87
00:10:07,919 --> 00:10:08,399
Go!

88
00:10:25,519 --> 00:10:26,159
Captain Xu,

89
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:26,919
you're here.

90
00:10:27,279 --> 00:10:28,200
The snipers on the gate tower

91
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,320
have killed so many of our men.

92
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,679
It's almost dawn,

93
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:31,840
and we still can't push through!

94
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:35,639
Leave it to me. I'll take them out.

95
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:36,840
All right.

96
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,519
Protect him!

97
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:42,159
Hurry, over here!

98
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,480
Captain, the snipers are dead!

99
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,759
Brothers, charge!

100
00:12:11,279 --> 00:12:18,679
Charge! Charge! Charge!

101
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:04,840
Brother!

102
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,080
Brother Lian!

103
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:53,960
All right.

104
00:14:55,399 --> 00:14:56,399
I promise you.

105
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:59,600
I will protect the Sanshan Gang.

106
00:15:33,399 --> 00:15:36,480
Comrades, reinforcements are here!

107
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:39,159
Reinforcements are here!

108
00:15:39,159 --> 00:15:43,240
Charge! Charge!

109
00:15:45,039 --> 00:15:45,799
Brother!

110
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,080
Brother Lian!

111
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:48,960
Brother!

112
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,360
Brother! Brother Lian!

113
00:15:50,879 --> 00:15:52,120
Brother Lian! Brother!

114
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,840
Brother Lian!

115
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:58,399
Brother!

116
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,679
Brother! Brother Lian!

117
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:06,399
September 3, 1941.

118
00:16:06,759 --> 00:16:08,159
Rongcheng was liberated.

119
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,519
The surviving members of the Sanshan Gang

120
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:13,120
joined the CPC Guerrillas.

121
00:16:13,279 --> 00:16:15,200
Their underworld lives came to an end,

122
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:17,159
yet the nation lives on,

123
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:19,279
and their bond endures forever.

124
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:19,919
They're all here.
